  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "In the adjoining figure triangle \\(ABC\\) is such that \\(AB=4\\) and \\(AC=8.\\) If \\(M\\) is the midpoint of \\(BC\\) and \\(AM=3,\\) what is the length of \\(BC?\\)",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(2\\sqrt{26}\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(2\\sqrt{31}\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(9\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(4+2\\sqrt{13}\\)"
    },
